{% comment %}
  "Is MizTweakz safe?" page.

  Every competitor FAQ in this category leads with safety, and the buyer reviews
  that convert say things like "didnt break my pc like other tweaks". The site
  had no page answering it. It targets: is miztweakz safe, are fps boosters
  safe, do fps boosters work, what does miztweakz change.

  IMPORTANT, read before editing any claim here. These were verified against the
  app source on 2026-09-12, not taken from marketing copy:

    - No process injection. No CreateRemoteThread, WriteProcessMemory,
      VirtualAllocEx or SetWindowsHookEx anywhere in the source.
    - No writes to game files. electron/graphics-ipc.js touches Fortnite's
      install path only to check the exe exists and read its icon for the UI.
    - Restore points are real: Checkpoint-Computer and Enable-ComputerRestore
      in electron/tools-ipc.js and electron/tweaks-ipc.js.
    - The NVIDIA profile reverts by importing NVIDIA's own stock Fortnite
      profile rather than undoing writes one by one.

  There is deliberately NO blanket "anti-cheat safe" claim. The app's own UI
  warns that some anti-cheat software disallows overlays, so that caveat is
  stated here in the same terms rather than papered over. Do not upgrade this
  page's language to promise anti-cheat compatibility.
{% endcomment %}

